# Scope

Desktop wallet only. zerod from [Zero](https://github.com/zerocurrencycoin/zero) repo; `ZERO_DIR` default `../Zero/src`.

**Build:** qmake, `zero-qt-wallet.pro`. Scripts: `mkrelease-mac.sh`, `mkrelease-linux.sh`, `mkrelease-win.sh`. See BUILD.md.

**Project docs:** UpdateWallet.
